# A++ Contributors File

This is a credits file for individuals who have contributed to the A++ project. It is sorted by name and formatted to allow easy grepping.

The fields are as follows:

- Name (N): Contributor's full name.
- Email (E): Contact email address.
- Website (W): Personal or professional web address (optional).
- Description (D): Brief description of contributions to A++.
- GitHub (G): GitHub profile (because we love seeing those commits).
- Country/City (C): Country, City, or Both (only if you feel like sharing).

To everyone listed here: your efforts have been instrumental in making A++ awesome. Thank you for your creativity, your code, and your belief in this project. We're grateful to have you on this journey!

